Description:
    Scaffolds a complete domain-specific context with pre-configured skills,
    agents, and example models for common application types like e-commerce,
    SaaS, blogs, and more.

Example:
    rails generate claude:context ecommerce

    This will create:
        .claude/skills/            - Domain-specific skills (models, controllers, etc.)
        .claude/agents/            - Context-specific agent (ecommerce-dev)
        .claude/contexts/          - Context documentation and model examples

Available Contexts:
    ecommerce   - E-commerce store with products, cart, orders, and payments
    saas        - SaaS application with subscriptions, billing, and multi-tenancy
    blog        - Blog platform with posts, comments, and tags
    social      - Social network with users, posts, follows, and feeds
    api         - JSON API backend with authentication and versioning
    marketplace - Two-sided marketplace with buyers, sellers, and transactions

Options:
    --skip-models   - Don't generate model examples
    --skip-agents   - Don't create context-specific agents

Examples:
    # Set up e-commerce context
    rails g claude:context ecommerce

    # Set up SaaS context without model examples
    rails g claude:context saas --skip-models

    # Set up API context without custom agent
    rails g claude:context api --skip-agents
